AltoStaking::addContainer()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── given valid container and multiplier
    │   ├── it should add container to storage
    │   ├── it should set container multiplier
    │   ├── it should emit ContainerMultiplierUpdated event
    │   ├── it should keep container inactive by default
    │   ├── it should not update max multiplier container id
    │   └── it should increment total container count
    ├── given multiple containers added
    │   └── it should add all containers with correct multipliers
    └── given invalid multiplier
        ├── when multiplier is zero
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when multiplier is greater than MATH_PRECISION
            └── it should revert

